# Purging Stormbrood cast from the hand as its Omen, Absorb Essence (CR 720.3): "Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains lifelink and
# hexproof until end of turn" for {1}{W}, an instant. On turn 3 Bot1 casts it on its Memnite (a 1/1, now 3/3 with lifelink), which
# attacks for 3: Bot2 goes to 17 and Bot1, who gains the damage dealt, to 23. A Mox Jet is no creature, so it is refused as the
# target (the refusal beside the allowed Memnite). As it resolves the Omen is shuffled into its owner's library (CR 720.3d): 13
# after the opening hand, 12 after the turn-3 draw, 13 again.

